        "id": "ch6_3_2-1",
        "text": "Oracle Database Server (Port 1521)\nThe Oracle database server uses TCP port 1521, and the same concepts apply\nto it as Microsoft SQL Server when it comes to enumeration:\nI\nI Brute-forcing credentials\nI\nI Identifying if the installed version is exploitable\nI\nI Basic enumeration scan of Oracle database\n$nmap -sV -O -sC -p 1521 [IP Address]\nI\nI Advanced enumeration scan of Oracle database\n$nmap -sV -O -p 1521 --script=oracle* [IP Address]\nI\nI Brute-force of Oracle database\n$ hydra -s 1521  -L [users file] -P [passwords file] [IP]",
